<!--
  ═══ U5 · T3 — LAUNCHER ON-SCREEN TEXT (English / en-GB) ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Translation of `values/strings_kachi.xml`. Same key set, always — `LauncherI18nContractTest` compares both
  directions, so a key present on one side only is a red test.

  ⚠ BRITISH English on purpose (`tyre`, `boot`, `colour`, `licence`, `motorway`): `:core` already translated its
  123 telemetry labels that way, and two spellings of "tyre pressure" on one screen reads like a bug.

  ⚠ This file must contain NO Vietnamese diacritics — the guard test rejects them. A Vietnamese sentence left in
  here would only ever be seen by an English-speaking user, i.e. it fails silently for everyone who reviews it.
-->
